sections.text:
An kat mouvman, de tan, enn de konsey!
Pa pou anwiye, seki swiv zot.
Kan enn bet aret twa lor semin, pase;
Prefer kanmem enn imbesil ki enn je-men-fou;
Pa fer nanye ki enn zour to bizin renie;
Krwar ki sak moman ki vini se dernie;
Les to servel an zasser de tan zan tan;
Trouv bon ki enn gardien vas fou pou so gardienn vas;
Aprann franse kot dimoun ki ti kone li;
Nene plat, pa pretann nene kourbe;
Viv bien pre ar later pou nouri to mwel;
Pli souvan ki to kapav get zetwal;
Voyaze; pa respir tro mem ler;
Ek zame res enn an san trouv lamer.
